# ABP Single-Layer Web Application Template

Simplified structure for smaller applications.

## Solution Structure
```
MyProject/
├── src/
│   └── MyProject/
│       ├── Data/           # DbContext, migrations
│       ├── Entities/       # Domain entities
│       ├── Services/       # Application services
│       ├── Pages/          # Razor pages / Blazor components
│       └── wwwroot/        # Static files
└── test/
    └── MyProject.Tests
```

## When to Use
- Small to medium applications
- Rapid prototyping
- Applications without complex domain logic
- When DDD layering is overkill

## Key Differences from Layered
- All code in single project
- No separate Domain/Application layers
- Simpler but less scalable
- Easier to get started
